# 1. Record architecture decisions

Date: {{ date }}

## Status

Accepted

## Context

Decisions about how this project is built outlive the conversation that
produced them. Six months on, the reasoning is gone and only the consequence
remains — at which point it looks arbitrary, and someone undoes it.

## Decision

Record every architectural decision as a numbered file in `docs/adr/`, newest
last, in the format above: context, decision, consequences. A decision that
replaces an earlier one says so, and the earlier one is marked superseded
rather than deleted — the history of why is the point.

## Consequences

Writing one is a small cost at the moment of deciding, and the payment comes
back the first time somebody asks "why is it like this?" and the answer is a
file rather than a guess.
